<p>Projects a bolt of pure blight, doing <acronym class="variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00,<br>spellpower 100">153, 205, 246, 281, 312</acronym> blight damage.</p><p>This spell has an improved critical strike chance of <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">+7.00%, +12%, +17%, +21%, +25%.</acronym></p><p>The damage will increase with your Spellpower.</p>